{"info": {"address1": "Unity Building Complex", "address2": "Ground Foor No. 3, Tower Block Mission Road", "city": "Bengaluru", "zip": "560027", "country": "India", "phone": "91 80 4660 7700", "website": "https://www.hcgoncology.com", "industry": "Medical Care Facilities", "industryKey": "medical-care-facilities", "industryDisp": "Medical Care Facilities", "sector": "Healthcare", "sectorKey": "healthcare", "sectorDisp": "Healthcare", "longBusinessSummary": "HealthCare Global Enterprises Limited provides medical and healthcare services in India and internationally. The company offers cancer diagnostics services, including genomics and molecular diagnostics, digital PET, preventive oncology, physical examination, laboratory tests, home health services, digital pathology, and CTC detection; treatment services, such as medical oncology and haemato-oncology, radiation and surgical oncology, molecular imaging and theranostics, chemotherapy, robotic surgery, actinium and lutetium therapy, immunotherapy, psycho-oncology, targeted drug therapy, bone marrow transplant, pediatric oncology, organ preservation and reconstructive surgery, endocrine therapy, and liver transplant; and post care services comprising patient care, psychological support, nutrition and dietetics, multidisciplinary rehabilitation, and genetic counselling. It also provides cancer screening, interventional radiology, MRI, nephrology, clinical trial, hormone therapy, hematology, CAR T cell, translational and nuclear medicine, oncodermatology, anaesthesiology, paediatric and gynaecologic oncology, orthopaedic oncology, uro-oncology, infectious diseases, gastrointestinal and thoracic oncology, breast surgical oncology, clinical pharmacology, and pain and palliative services. In addition, the company operates multi-specialty hospitals under the HCG brand that offers inpatient and outpatient treatments with specialties in cardiology, neurology, orthopaedics, gastroenterology, urology, internal medicine and pulmonary, and critical care. Further, it provides oncology diagnostics services, including biomarker and translational research, and clinical research services under the Triesta Sciences brand; and fertility treatment services, including reproductive medicine, assisted reproduction, gynecological endoscopy, and fertility preservation under the Milann brand. HealthCare Global Enterprises Limited was founded in 1989 and is headquartered in Bengaluru, India.", "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Sunu Manuel Abey", "title": "Compliance Officer & Company Secretary", "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 5840000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Dr. Manish  Mattoo", "title": "CEO, Interim CFO & Executive Director", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "V.  Venkataramanan", "age": 51, "title": "Senior Vice President of Finance & Accounts", "yearBorn": 1974, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Pankaj  Gautam", "title": "Chief Technology & Security Officer and Chief Information Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Romiya  Das", "title": "Public Relation Manager", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Ashutosh  Kumar", "title": "Vice President of Strategic Planning & Corporate Development", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Manu Shankar Das", "title": "Chief Marketing Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Deepti Gautam Tewari", "title": "Chief Human Resource Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Dr. Naveen Ramachandra Nagar", "age": 53, "title": "Head of Clinical Strategy", "yearBorn": 1972, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercised